## Project Structure

```text
finance_tracker/
│
├── main.py
├── finance.db
└── README.md
```

### Components

#### Transaction Class

Responsible for:

* Validating transaction data
* Standardizing inputs
* Saving transactions to the database

#### SQLite Database

Stores transaction information:

| Column      | Type    |
| ----------- | ------- |
| id          | INTEGER |
| type        | TEXT    |
| amount      | REAL    |
| date        | TEXT    |
| description | TEXT    |
| category    | TEXT    |

#### GUI

Built using Tkinter and provides:

* Add Income button
* Add Expense button
* View Summary button
* View Spending Chart button
* Exit button

#### Data Visualization

Matplotlib is used to generate spending distribution pie charts.

